abstract = 'Satyameva Aegis is a production-ready, full-stack blockchain credential verification and digital asset management platform developed for Smart India Hackathon (SIH 2026) under Problem Statement SIH26125. It permanently eliminates academic document fraud and replaces weeks of manual background verification with an instant, cryptographically anchored verification process taking under 2 seconds.\n\n1. THE PROBLEM\nIn India, over 40,000 fake degrees and forged marksheets are officially caught every year, with countless cases going undetected. Employers and verification agencies spend 2 to 4 weeks and thousands of rupees per applicant on manual registrar enquiries, while students face constant risk of losing physical certificates. Traditional paper credentials and static PDFs offer zero tamper-resistance, while existing institutional portals are fragmented, siloed, and lack automated cryptographic verification.\n\n2. PROPOSED SOLUTION & ARCHITECTURE\nSatyameva Aegis establishes a unified, multi-campus cryptographic trust network. The platform combines five security and intelligence layers:\n\n- Trust Layer (Blockchain Ledger): A custom Proof-of-Work blockchain engine (SHA-256, Difficulty 4) dual-persisted across SQLite and blockchain.json. Every issued document is anchored into an immutable block; any row-level database tampering breaks the chain and produces an immediate TAMPERED verdict.\n- Cryptographic Layer (Identity & Data Integrity): Employs PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 with 100,000 iterations and per-document random salting. On every verification request, the system re-derives the cryptographic digest from scratch from stored payload data, guaranteeing zero silent passes.\n- Intelligence Layer (Google Gemini 2.0 Flash AI): Multimodal AI document parsing automatically extracts structured credential fields (student name, roll number, document title, issue date, grade) from uploaded certificate scans, dramatically accelerating registrar workflows.\n- Access Control Layer (Role-Based Access Control): Enforces strict isolation across Student, Issuer, Verifier, and Super Admin portals with resource-level ownership validation (403 forbidden for unauthorized access).\n- Verification Layer (Permanent Institutional QR): High-contrast QR codes embedded with official university crests using Error Correction Level H (~30%) and a revolving cyber radar HUD animation. Verification links are lifetime-valid, permanent, and cryptographically anchored directly to the ledger.\n\n3. KEY FEATURES & CAPABILITIES\n- Instant Public Verification: Employers verify credentials on the public portal without requiring user accounts, receiving an authentic verdict in under 2 seconds.\n- AI-Assisted Bulk Issuance: Automated CSV bulk issuance with an all-or-nothing atomic validator. If any single row is malformed, zero documents are written and zero orphaned blocks are mined.\n- Self-Sovereign Student Wallet: Students retain permanent ownership of all earned credentials, featuring 3D interactive card-flip ledger inspectors and one-click Stamped PDF certificate downloads.\n- Automated Gmail SMTP Dispatch: Real-time email notifications sent to students upon credential issuance and verification checks from hackathonsage@gmail.com.\n- Super Admin Control Center: Multi-campus management (JIIT Noida, JUIT Waknaghat, JUET Guna), user role management, institution approval/revocation, and real-time blockchain block explorer.\n- Native Desktop Application Mode: One-click silent background launcher opening Satyameva in a frameless, standalone application window with a custom 3D Cyber Shield desktop icon.\n\n4. FEASIBILITY, METRICS & ECONOMIC IMPACT\n- Verification Speed: Reduced from 2 to 4 weeks down to under 2 seconds (over 99.99% faster).\n- Cost Efficiency: Zero gas fees for in-house ledger processing, with public blockchain scaling (Polygon) costing approximately Rs 0.08 per credential (saving Rs 500 to Rs 2,000 per check).\n- National Addressability: Designed to scale across 40M+ higher-education students in India.\n- Environmental & Policy Alignment: Fully paperless, eliminates physical courier overhead between universities, and directly aligns with the National Education Policy (NEP 2020) and Digital India initiatives.\n\n5. PROTOTYPE STATUS & VERIFICATION\nThe platform is fully implemented, verified, and operational:\n- 11/11 Automated End-to-End (E2E) Integration Test Suites Passed (100%).\n- 4-Tier Bulk CSV Atomic Batch Validation Passed.\n- Full HTTP 200 Route Smoke Tests Passed across all portals.\n- Live Prototype Endpoint: http://127.0.0.1:5000\n- Video Walkthrough: https://youtu.be/Uu-bOJTZrFY\n\n6. SCALABILITY & NATIONAL ROADMAP\n- Phase 1 (Operational Prototype): Live deployment across Jaypee Group institutions (JIIT Noida, JUIT Waknaghat, JUET Guna).\n- Phase 2 (State & National Expansion): REST API integration with DigiLocker and the National Academic Depository (NAD) to serve state and central universities nationwide.\n- Phase 3 (Universal Trust Ledger): Extending beyond academic credentials to professional certifications, government identity, and digital asset provenance.'
print(f'Length: {len(abstract)} characters')
